  "concept": {
    "zh": "中戏导演校考第六名，北电高表学院的徐圣洁导演执导的生命与家庭主题短片，主要担任摄影、剪辑和音乐工作。48小时极限制片挑战，在分镜脚本缺失的情况下与导演现场沟通演员安排与摄影机调度，在每场结束后高效利用ChatGPT制作准确的分镜脚本。剪辑时擅长贴合导演艺术表达形式，用符合主题的配乐调配短片节奏，在素材量极少的情况下完成了最终的成品制作。",
    "en": "Produced as part of a 48-hour filmmaking challenge, the project began without a complete shooting script. On set, I worked closely with the directors to coordinate actor blocking and camera movement. After each scene, I used ChatGPT to compile detailed shot-by-shot records of the footage. In the edit, I shaped the limited material around the directors’ artistic vision, using music that reflected the film’s themes to establish its rhythm and bring the finished piece together."
  },
